{"id":"n32424-1-8","stage":2,"title":"교시 · 教时","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32424-1-8-1","ko":"오늘은 수업이 언제 끝나니?","zh":"今天课程什么时候结束啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘은","audio":"/audio/45021ad1ec5b4083b856.mp3"}},{"text":"수업이","meaning":"授课，讲课","explanation":"수업：授课，讲课；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수업","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64597","senseId":"1","lemma":"수업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수업이","audio":"/audio/c932de5b31ba0297918b.mp3"}},{"text":"언제","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}},{"text":"끝나니?","meaning":"下课，下班","explanation":"끝나다：下课，下班；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"4","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝나니","audio":"/audio/7019dd7dc14ecd0460b3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"01c1761e85dc638b","term":"수업","zh":"授课，讲课","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3","entryId":"64597","definition":"教师教学生知识或技术。","pronunciation":["수업"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"