","term":"토요일","zh":"星期六，周六，礼拜六","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3","entryId":"30214","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的第六天。","pronunciation":["토요일"]},{"id":"3cd6c40aac5fd42e","term":"삼","zh":"三","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3","entryId":"61854","definition":"二加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["삼"]},{"id":"dedfafc09ab37685","term":"교시","zh":"教时，课时","audio":"/audio/dedfafc09ab37685dd9f.mp3","entryId":"32424","definition":"计算学校上课时间的数量单位。","pronunciation":["교ː시"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"因为，由于","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示原因。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"下课，下班","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"在学校或公司等地方做完当天的功课或业务。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/88ea7a86bd216be57827.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.933,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=32424","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":67,"sequenceScore":1.7597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["今天课程什么时候结束啊？","因为是周六，只上到第三节课就结束了。","为什么一直回头看？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天课程什么时候结束啊？","因为是周六，只上到第三节课就结束了。","为什么一直回头看？"],"answer":1}]}
